        <mxCell id="ZblBVeZuAxSfTw1MTgEL-19" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Configure GPIO&#39;s&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;configure_gpio()&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Configure output GPIOs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Set selected pins as outputs, no pulls, no interrupts; mute amplifier.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Configure input GPIOs with interrupts&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Laser receiver: input, pull-up enabled, rising-edge interrupt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Hall sensor: input, no pulls, any-edge interrupt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Set up GPIO interrupt handling&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Install ISR service and attach ISRs for laser and hall sensors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Create event queue and worker task&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;ISRs push events to a queue; a dedicated task processes them.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;" vertex="1" parent="ZblBVeZuAxSfTw1MTgEL-31">
